#   之 (verb 'to go to', 之三子); 方 ('to compare', Zhu Xi 方比也); 道 ('to speak of', Zhu Xi 道言也); 恥 ('to hold
#   back from, not dare to go the full length', Zhu Xi 不敢盡之意); 過 ('to go beyond, have more than enough');
#   犯 ('to stand up to (a lord), remonstrate', Zhu Xi 犯顔諫爭); 億 (信 'distrust' as 不信 — Zhu Xi 人疑己);
#   抑 (Zhu Xi 反語辭, turning the sentence); 寡 ('to make few'); 經 is new (above).
# Not bound, meaning what their parts mean: 仁 | 者, 知 | 者, 勇 | 者 (as 9.28), 溝 | 瀆, 賓 | 客 (as 5.8),
