# Collation (Ruan 1816 KR1h0004; He Yan SBCK KR1h0005). Ruan agrees with Zhu Xi throughout this part (it sets
#   14.27 and 14.28 together in one chapter). He Yan, noted in the unit: 28 子曰衛靈公之無道也; 30 則其為之難也;
#   31, 32 殺 for 弑, 陳桓 for 陳恒; 33–35 二三子 for 三子, last 不敢不告 without 也; 38 為人也; 40 孔子與人坐
#   (hedged as a possible slip); 43 恥其言之過其行也; 46 賢乎我 (hedged as a likely slip); 47 患己無能也;
